   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RURAL INVESTMENT AND LOCAL GOVERNANCE PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the Project is to contribute to rural development and poverty reduction through supporting provision of priority public goods and services at the commune level, as well as to promote good local governance through support of decentralized and deconcentrated participatory local governance systems at the commune and provincial levels.</narrative>
